= Johnny Lothian

Lothian is the head teacher of Morgan Academy, he is also an advocate for the party's move towards the right.

- @right_wing
- @nsdap
- @rally_with_the_right
- @root: Return to main

@right_wing
title: Move towards the Right
subtitle: Bring in reformist views into the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5; reformist_strength += 10; reformist_dissent -= 5; neorevisionist_strength += 5; neorevisionist_dissent -= 10;

We have brought in new, some might say unorthodox, ideas into the party. The left, centrist and labor factions express their displeasure.

@nsdap
title: Right-wing Relations
subtitle: Increase ties between the SPD and the far-right parties.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent += 15; center_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 15; DNVP_relation += 10; NSDAP_relation += 10

We have aligned ourselves with the far-right parties, the Communists are outraged whilst the bourgeoisie were unamoured.

@rally_with_the_right
title: Rally with the Right
subtitle: Lothian could knit closer ties with the Right to stave off the Communist support.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and NSDAP_relation >= 50 and DNVP_relation >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if NSDAP_relation <= 50 or DNVP_relation <= 50 : We need higher relations with the far-right parties. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; 
go-to: crisis_program.support_left 

